    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you're saying transit proximity is the \"only\" approach that works? That seems pretty extreme. What about the people who are currently at the very bottom of the income bracket but live in areas with okay transit? Wouldn't prioritizing them based strictly on income be more equitable than focusing on location?",
